  "title": "Charles Griffin speaks with Law360 about the Blue Cross Blue Shield settlement opt-outs",
  "summary": "Charles Griffin speaks with Law360 about the Blue Cross Blue Shield (BCBS) settlement opt-outs. Hospitals and other healthcare providers face a deadline on March 4, 2025, when they must decide whether to opt out of the class in the BCBS antitrust litigation, which alleges insufficient reimbursements to hospitals, physician groups and other healthcare providers. Learn more.",
